[Unit]
Description=AI Employee services: low CPU priority and a memory cap, the server's other sites come first

[Slice]
# A low weight, not a hard quota: the server's other sites win whenever the CPU is busy, and an idle CPU still runs
# a call at full speed. A CPUQuota throttled Whisper / Kokoro (they start a thread per core) and broke up the audio.
CPUWeight=20
MemoryMax=16G
